	CS:group.AddReleaseDetails^WEB^Global Data^N^N
		CS:groupcontent.field.ReleaseNumber^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ReleaseNumber^Up until the point that the aircraft is released, the Release Number can be added by clicking **Record Release**. It can later be viewed for a Released turn by clicking **View Release** from the ***Aircraft Turn Details*** page. The release number displayed is the last recorded release number associated with the aircraft on the turn.^
		CE:
		CS:groupcontent.field.ReleaseRemarks^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ReleaseRemarks^Up until the point that the aircraft is released, release remarks can be added by clicking **Record Release**. It can later be viewed for a Released turn by clicking **View Release** on the ***Aircraft Turn Details*** page.^
		CE:
	CE:
