			D:ReleaseNumber^Up until the point that the aircraft is released, the Release Number can be added by clicking **Record Release**. It can later be viewed for a Released turn by clicking **View Release** from the ***Aircraft Turn Details*** page. The release number displayed is the last recorded release number associated with the aircraft on the turn.^
