	CS:list.TaskList^WEB^Global Data^N^N
		CS:listcontent.badge.IsCmsWarningsExist^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:IsCmsWarningsExist^^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.badge.MaterialAvailabilityStatus^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:MaterialAvailabilityStatus^Indicates the material availability for the task.\&10\* **Open**: At least one material line is unfulfilled.\&10\* **On Order**: No material lines are open; at least one is on order.\&10\* **Remote**: No material lines are open or on-order; at least one is remote.\&10\* **Available**: All material lines are fulfilled. Inventory is reserved and ready to issue.\&10\* **Issued**: All materials are issued for the task.\&10\* **N/A**: No material lines for this task.\&10\* **Processing**: At least one material line is being processed.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.badge.Objstate^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:Objstate^A task has one of the following statuses:#* **Active**- The task was created but has not started.#* **In Work**-The task was started.#* **Complete**- The task was completed.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.badge.OverallAssignmentsProgress^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:OverallAssignmentsProgress^Displays the overall status of skill assignments within the task.\&10\\&10\* Not Started \2013 All assignments are either assigned or unassigned.\&10\* In Progress \2013 At least one assignment is in the **Work Started** status.\&10\* Paused \2013 Some assignments are completed, while others are assigned or unassigned.\&10\* Finished \2013 All assignments are completed.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.badge.RequestStateCd^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:RequestStateCd^A business entity takes on a status as follows:\&10\* SENT \2013 The business entity is in the process of being synchronized with an external service. \&10\* SUCCEEDED- The business entity has been successfully synchronized with the external service.\&10\* FAILED \2013 The synchronization of the business entity with the external service has failed.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.badge.Sensitivities^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:Sensitivities^^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.ActualFinish^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ActualFinish^^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.ActualStart^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ActualStart^^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.ConfigPosition^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ConfigPosition^The specific configuration slot position to which the task or fault relates.\00A0^
