		CS:listcontent.field.ShiftEnd^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ShiftEnd^The starting time of the resource's shift.  \&10\\&10\* If the resource has a shift, which falls within the scheduled start and scheduled end of the skill requirement, the Shift Start and Shift End of that shift will be displayed accordingly. \&10\* If the resource does not have a shift, which falls within the scheduled start and scheduled end of the skill requirement, the Shift Start and Shift End of the next closest shift will be displayed accordingly. \&10\* If the resource does not have shifts set up in the system, the Shift Start and Shift End values will be empty.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.ShiftStart^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:ShiftStart^The starting time of the resource's shift.  \&10\\&10\* If the resource has a shift, which falls within the scheduled start and scheduled end of the skill requirement, the Shift Start and Shift End of that shift will be displayed accordingly. \&10\* If the resource does not have a shift, which falls within the scheduled start and scheduled end of the skill requirement, the Shift Start and Shift End of the next closest shift will be displayed accordingly. \&10\* If the resource does not have shifts set up in the system, the Shift Start and Shift End values will be empty.^
		CE:
