	CS:list.CriticalItemList^WEB^Global Data^N^N
		CS:listcontent.badge.Objstate^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:Objstate^The status of the Critical Item.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.CriticalItem^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:CriticalItem^Critical Item refers to a task, defect, or component within a work order (WO) that requires immediate attention due to its potential impact on operational efficiency or aircraft delivery timelines. These items are typically flagged as high priority based on severity and demand proactive tracking and resolution.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.UpdatedDateTime^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:UpdatedDateTime^This field indicates the most recent date and time when the record was added or updated in the system. It is typically automatically set by the system during update operations and helps in tracking changes, maintaining data integrity, and auditing.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.UpdatedUser^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:UpdatedUser^This field indicates the user who created or last modified the Critical Item record.^
		CE:
