		CS:listcontent.lookup.AvCriticalItemTypeRef^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:AvCriticalItemTypeRef^This field indicates the classification of a critical item based on its role, risk level, or operational importance. This helps in prioritizing maintenance, monitoring, and compliance procedures.^
