	CS:group.AddPartsPartRequirement^WEB^Global Data^N^N
		CS:groupcontent.field.IncludeInstallation^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:IncludeInstallation^Adds a part installation record. You cannot add another part installation requirement for the same position and configuration slot if a part installation record for that position and configuration slot already exists unless the existing part requirement has been signed off.^
		CE:
		CS:groupcontent.field.IncludeRemoval^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:IncludeRemoval^Adds a part removal record. You cannot add another part removal requirement for the same position and configuration slot if a part removal record for that position and configuration slot already exists in the same work package.^
		CE:
		CS:groupcontent.lookup.RemovalReasonRef^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:RemovalReasonRef^Select the part removal reason. If you do not select the part removal reason when adding a part, you need to select it when recording work for the part removal.^
