		CS:groupcontent.field.RequestCorrelationId^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:RequestCorrelationId^The ID used to track the communication for a given transaction. The Request Correlation ID correlates to the Correlation ID on the ***Communication Log*** page and can be used to look up the communication on the **Communication Log** page, to troubleshoot a communication error, if required.^
		CE:
		CS:groupcontent.field.TaskCode^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:TaskCode^The task code is the code assigned to the task definition, and for actual tasks based on task definitions, the task code is the first part of the name of the task. For ad hoc tasks, the task name is its code.^
