	CS:list.AvMatReqDetailList^WEB^Global Data^N^N
		CS:listcontent.badge.OrderStatus^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:OrderStatus^Indicates the fulfillment status of each material line.\&10\* **Open**: No inventory is reserved, pegged, or on order. Requirement unfulfilled.\&10\* **Available**: Inventory reserved and ready to issue.\&10\* **On Orde**r: Items are on a purchase order but not yet received.\&10\* **Issued**: Inventory has been issued to task.\&10\* **Remote**: Requirement fulfilled through stock from a different site.\&10\* **Processing**: Requirement is being processed.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.BatchNumber^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:BatchNumber^^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.CreatedBy^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:CreatedBy^The user who originally entered the material line.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.DateRequired^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:DateRequired^Specifies the latest date the requested part must be available at the maintenance site. If the related work package is in **Active** status, this date defaults to the work package's scheduled start date. If the work package is in **In Work** status, the date defaults to today's date.^
		CE:
