		CS:listcontent.field.PurchaseMethod^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:PurchaseMethod^This field indicates the type of purchase required to fulfill the demand. There are four different purchase methods that may appear on a purchase requisition:\&10\1. **Regular Purchase Order** \2013 Use Order Code 1 (Normal) for this type of purchase.\&10\2. **Exchange Order** \2013 Use Order Code 1 (Normal) for this and ensure the exchange part is included in the line item.\&10\3.  **Repair Order** \2013 Use Order Code 6 (External Service Order) for this.\&10\4.  **Borrow Order** \2013 Use Order Code 1 (Normal) along with the 'Supplier Loan' part to indicate ownership.^
