		CS:listcontent.field.SenderId^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:SenderId^The unique identification of the sender who supplies materials on demand ex: Supplier ID.\&10\\&10\When the material line Supply Code is Shipment Order, Sender ID is a Site or Remote Warehouse that belongs to same site or another site of same company as Demand Site.\&10\\&10\When the Supply Code is Distribution Order, Sender ID is a Site that belongs to a different company than the Demand Site.^
		CE:
		CS:listcontent.field.SenderType^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:SenderType^The type of sender who will supply materials required for the services at the service location ex: Supplier.^
