		CS:listcontent.field.SupplySite^WEB^Data Field^N^N
			D:SupplySite^When the material line Supply Code is Shipment Order or Distribution Order, the Supply Site indicates the site of the sender who sends materials required for services at the Demand Site. \&10\\&10\When the Supply Code is Shipment Order, Supply Site could be the same site or another site of the same company as Demand Site. \&10\\&10\When the Supply Code is Distribution Order, Supply Site is a site that belongs to a different company than the Demand Site.^
